  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Retrospective application for erection of roof extension to main rear roof. (Revision planning permission ref. 2022/0788)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The development, by reason of its scale, design and location constitutes an unsympathetic and incongruous form of development that competes with and dominates the existing property causing unacceptable harm to the character and appearance of the terrace and wider area. The development therefore fails to comply with policies LP1 and LP5 of the Wandsworth Local Plan (2023) and the Housing SPD (2016).",
    "Reason : 2 - In dealing with this application the Council has implemented the requirement in the National Planning Policy Framework to make available detailed advice in the form of our statutory policies in the Local Plan as well as offering a full pre application advice service. However, we have been unable to seek solutions to problems as the proposal is clearly contrary to our statutory policies and negotiation could not overcome the reasons for refusal."
